      "content": "Q1. Value of g on Earth? Ans: 9.8 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eelou2c",
      "content": "Q2. Who gave Universal Law of Gravitation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "we8oq7l",
      "content": "Ans: Newton"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bma16a2",
      "content": "Q3. SI unit of weight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
